      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks, this is a great start. \n\ncan we tweak the part about the \"unexplained nuisances\"? i want to be a bit more specific so tenants don't think we're just being vague. maybe describe it as those moments where the system feels like it's being sabotaged by something small and unseen—like tiny, invisible disruptions that are almost like little pests or tricksters working inside the vents to mess with the settings. \n\ni want it to convey that if we don't catch these \"troublemakers\" now through maintenance, they'll just keep causing more chaos later. can you weave that in while keeping the overall tone professional?",
      "source": "evaluator"
